Name: surya-ocr
Version: 0.22.1
Summary: OCR, layout, reading order, and table recognition in 90+ languages.
Usage: surya_ocr [OPTIONS] INPUT_PATH

  OCR text — full-page OCR (one VLM call per page).

Options:
  --keep_server      Keep the inference server (vllm/llama.cpp) running after
                     this command exits so later commands reuse it instead of
                     re-spawning.
  -d, --debug        Enable debug mode.
  --images           Save images of detected bboxes.
  --page_range TEXT  Page range to convert, specify comma separated page
                     numbers or ranges.  Example: 0,5-10,20
  --output_dir PATH  Directory to save output.
  --help             Show this message and exit.
